        "created_at": "2014-01-19T19:10:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It would be rather rubbing people's noses in it if I said it was K.N.Y.F.E.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ahhh, alright then. I won't reveal the secret to anyone.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Wanna know what would be fun for a complex 1 hero? If that hero was Ra, and the person playing Ra put Wrathful Gaze and used it every single round. Oh wait! We just did that on Friday. Or was it Thursday? Oh well, it was recently.</p>",
